  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Boş partiyi en başta yakala: `if not rows: return {...}`; yoksa bölmede sıfıra bölme hatası alırsın.",
      "en": "Catch the empty batch at the very start: `if not rows: return {...}`; otherwise you get a division by zero."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`if check_row(row, schema):` dolu listeyi `True` sayar. Durum: `\"rejected\" if quarantined / len(rows) > max_bad_share else \"accepted\"`.",
      "en": "`if check_row(row, schema):` counts a filled list as `True`. The status: `\"rejected\" if quarantined / len(rows) > max_bad_share else \"accepted\"`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom rules import SCHEMA, check_row\nfrom ml_data import make_customers\n\n\ndef gate(rows, schema, max_bad_share):\n    if not rows:\n        return {\"status\": \"rejected\", \"good\": 0, \"quarantined\": 0}\n    good = 0\n    quarantined = 0\n    for row in rows:\n        if check_row(row, schema):\n            quarantined += 1\n        else:\n            good += 1\n    status = \"rejected\" if quarantined / len(rows) > max_bad_share else \"accepted\"\n    return {\"status\": status, \"good\": good, \"quarantined\": quarantined}\n\n\nbatch = make_customers(200, seed=5)\nresult = gate(batch, SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\nfor row in batch[:12]:\n    row[\"plan\"] = \"PRO\"\nresult = gate(batch, SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\nresult = gate([], SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**main.py**\n\n```python\nfrom rules import SCHEMA, check_row\nfrom ml_data import make_customers\n\n\ndef gate(rows, schema, max_bad_share):\n    if not rows:\n        return {\"status\": \"rejected\", \"good\": 0, \"quarantined\": 0}\n    good = 0\n    quarantined = 0\n    for row in rows:\n        if check_row(row, schema):\n            quarantined += 1\n        else:\n            good += 1\n    status = \"rejected\" if quarantined / len(rows) > max_bad_share else \"accepted\"\n    return {\"status\": status, \"good\": good, \"quarantined\": quarantined}\n\n\nbatch = make_customers(200, seed=5)\nresult = gate(batch, SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\nfor row in batch[:12]:\n    row[\"plan\"] = \"PRO\"\nresult = gate(batch, SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\nresult = gate([], SCHEMA, 0.05)\nprint(result[\"status\"], result[\"good\"], result[\"quarantined\"])\n```"
    }
  ],
